{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2023-05/1066005/block/singleImage/3279576/wm/2022%E5%B0%96%E6%B2%99%E5%92%80%E8%AD%A6%E7%BD%B201.jpg?updatedAt=1795705298\"/><figcaption>尖沙咀警署。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>尖沙咀懷疑有貓隻受虐。周四早上9時許，加連威老道100號一間動物診所獸醫報案指，發現一隻貓身體多處骨折，懷疑牠被人不恰當對待。警方到場及初步調查後，以涉嫌「殘酷對待動物」拘捕一名28歲女貓主及其27歲男友。 兩名被捕人現正被扣留調查。案件交由油尖警區刑事調查隊第九隊跟進，涉案貓隻稍後將會交由相關機構照顧並進行進一步檢查。據報，有人帶貓隻求醫時未能交代牠為何受傷，亦否認曾虐待動物。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:44:22.461161+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T15:01:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T22:29:04.646710+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:37:36.861266+00:00","content_hash":"f40c1d7aff7a551f16b9082c690a347801dd94893e8844c49ccfc6c84259105a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:44:22.461161+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}